<title>POLAND: NBP DRAINS PLN 136 MLN, MAX RATE UP TO 19.15 PCT.</title>
<headline>NBP DRAINS PLN 136 MLN, MAX RATE UP TO 19.15 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland drained 136 million zlotys from the market through a reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction after banks bid to place 143 million with the central bank, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The bank drained the market for 14 days at a maximum rate of 19.15 percent, up from 19.13 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
